# ============================================================================
# Repository layout
#   Tracked : NN/  and  HFSM_ Frenet_quintic_ LTV-MPC/
#   Local   : everything else below (datasets, weights, generated outputs)
# ============================================================================

# --- Other local folders and course material (not part of this repo) --------
/Highway Lane Change Planner and Controller/
/Highway Trajectory Planning Using Frenet Reference Path/
/Path-planning-for-the-L2-lateral-feature/
/tmp/
/*.pdf

# --- Datasets and model weights (exceed GitHub limits) ----------------------
# comma2k19 clips, lane caches, HDF5 windows, teacher caches (~22 GB).
# Rebuild with build_dataset.py / prepare_*.py after downloading comma2k19.
NN/data/
# Polar R-CNN and openpilot checkpoints (~825 MB; one ONNX file is 733 MB).
# Download from the upstream release / re-export with export_*.py.
NN/models/

# --- Generated scenario bundles for the static UI (~61 MB) ------------------
# Rebuild with: python -m l2_path_planner ui --all
HFSM_ Frenet_quintic_ LTV-MPC/ui/data/

# --- Simulation logs and run outputs ---------------------------------------
# Rebuild with: python -m l2_path_planner run --config configs/baseline.json
HFSM_ Frenet_quintic_ LTV-MPC/outputs/

# --- Vendored third-party clones (kept locally, not versioned) --------------
# PolarRCNN and Ultra-Fast-Lane-Detection-v2 are upstream clones with their own
# .git history. Clone them next to this project instead of committing them:
#   NN/third_party/PolarRCNN
#   NN/third_party/Ultra-Fast-Lane-Detection-v2
NN/third_party/

# --- Python caches, build artefacts, virtual environments -------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
pytest-cache-files-*/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Large binary formats (defence in depth) --------------------------------
*.hevc
*.mp4
*.avi
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.bag

# --- OS / editor metadata ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
